{"availability":"available","full":"Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer","name":"SoulX-Singer","description":"Official inference code for SoulX-Singer: Towards High-Quality Zero-Shot Singing Voice Synthesis","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":979,"forks":147,"created":"2026-02-06T11:54:20Z","updated":"2026-05-29T03:46:36Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T19:20:48.969Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T19:20:48.969Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T19:20:48.969Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:46.069Z","stars":978,"forks":147},{"at":"2026-10-04T19:20:48.969Z","stars":979,"forks":147}],"technologies":["Python"],"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:38:10.667Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SoulX-Singer is a high-fidelity, zero-shot singing voice synthesis model that enables users to generate realistic singing voices for unseen singers. It supports melody-conditioned (F0 contour) and score-conditioned (MIDI notes) control for precise pitch, rhythm, and expression.","SoulX-Singer-SVC is a singing voice conversion (SVC) model finetuned from SoulX-Singer. Singing Voice Conversion aims to transform a source singing recording into the target singer’s voice while preserving the original melody, rhythm, and lyrical content. Based on the strong generative capability of SoulX-Singer, SoulX-Singer-SVC enables high-quality singing voice conversion directly from raw singing audio, without requiring lyric or MIDI transcriptions."],"features":["🎤 Zero-Shot Singing – Generate high-fidelity voices for unseen singers, no fine-tuning needed.","🎵 Flexible Control Modes – Melody (F0) and Score (MIDI) conditioning.","📚 Large-Scale Dataset – 42,000+ hours of aligned vocals, lyrics, notes across Mandarin, English, Cantonese.","🧑‍🎤 Timbre Cloning – Preserve singer identity across languages, styles, and edited lyrics.","✏️ Singing Voice Editing – Modify lyrics while keeping natural prosody."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"886dc06a01a442c863498adf32aa0ef90108726eb0866661af86082ac8f5163a","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:15:36.118Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:19:13.364Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-05-29T03:46:36Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"SoulX-Singer is a high-fidelity, zero-shot singing voice synthesis model that enables users to generate realistic singing voices for unseen singers. It supports melody-conditioned (F0 contour) and score-conditioned (MIDI notes) control for precise pitch, rhythm, and expression.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"886dc06a01a442c863498adf32aa0ef90108726eb0866661af86082ac8f5163a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:19:13.365Z"},"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:50.143Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:50.143Z","screenshots":[],"demoHealth":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer","attemptedAt":"2026-10-03T14:18:40.204Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:18:40.204Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-03T14:18:40.204Z","target":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer","failureCount":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-10T14:18:40.204Z"},"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:59.455Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:19:13.366Z","hash":"886dc06a01a442c863498adf32aa0ef90108726eb0866661af86082ac8f5163a","originalBytes":10296,"storedBytes":10296,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["singing","soulx-singer","voice","conversion","svc","synthesis","demo","midi","install","download","face","hugging","inference","model","models","